Most negative rho -0.714; median n for the inverse-estimate genes 30 models.
Quote the FDR-supported count, not the raw inverse count. And note what it licenses:
an FDR-supported INVERSE ASSOCIATION, not 'transcript is not a proxy' - an inverse
relationship can still be predictive, in the other direction.

